# Brenz run tools

## Rules
- Use SweetPad to build, run on the simulator and read logs.
- Use Xcode MCP for the other Xcode tasks.
- Use the shared scheme `Brenz`.
- Run only one build tool at a time.
- Test Auth and Firestore on the simulator, with the Firestore emulator when it applies.
- Build for an iPhone simulator, not a device, unless asked.

## Forbidden
- Do not build with SweetPad and Xcode MCP at the same time.
- Do not change the Xcode MCP configuration.
- Do not edit `.xcodeproj` by hand. Use Xcode MCP.
- Do not commit `buildServer.json` or `.sweetpad/` unless decided otherwise.
